Backport of OpenMathLib/OpenBLAS#6105 (removes contention in the default,
non-TLS buffer allocator when many threads call BLAS at once) onto 0.3.30.
The first commit is the part of OpenMathLib/OpenBLAS#5876 that #6105 builds
on: the buffer table's fields become _Atomic. The only other change from
upstream: new_release_info keeps its malloc instead of the calloc upstream
adopted with OpenMathLib/OpenBLAS#5960, which 0.3.30 lacks.

